  "description": "*\"Wow... my sister is insanely cool!\"*\n\nA Duke who can’t take his eyes off me. A dazzling, flawless older sister. I thought I’d been reincarnated as the youngest daughter of a ducal family in a sweet childcare romance fantasy, a cozy world where everyone dotes on me.\n\n*\"...Wait. This isn’t a childcare story at all!\"*\n\nTurns out, the novel I possessed isn’t a heartwarming family story, it’s a revenge story. And worse, the person I’ve possessed is the villainous younger sister, destined to be destroyed by her older sister, the very woman I once killed in a past life.\n\n*\"Uh... sister?\"*\n\nIf I want to survive, there’s only one rule, stay on my sister’s good side at all costs. And live as quietly, invisibly, and harmlessly as possible.\n\n*\"I just picked it up on the way.\"*\n\nBut... my sister is acting kind of strange.\n\n*\"If you ever get cast out of the family, I’ll take you in.\"*\n\nAnd wait, who is this now?\n\n(Source: KakaoPage, translated)",
